    <bib:Memo rdf:about="#item_192">
        <rdf:value>&lt;div data-schema-version=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;stable, long-running industrial microservices&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;propose a proactive method for optimizing the selection and allocation of heterogeneous server types, aiming to minimize TCO for stable, long-running industrial microservices&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;a systematic and automated approach for identifying cost-optimal deployment configurations, leveraging the diverse characteristics of available cloud instance types and the heterogeneous demands of industrial microservices&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</rdf:value>
    </bib:Memo>
