        <dc:title>Say Goodbye to Cluster Autoscaler: Meet Karpenter for Kubernetes Scaling</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>Are traditional Kubernetes autoscaling methods slowing you down? Say hello to Karpenter, the open source alternative redefining Cluster Autoscaler functionality.</dcterms:abstract>
