        <link:link rdf:resource="#item_281"/>
        <dc:title>Trimaran | Scheduler Plugins</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>Trimaran: Load-aware scheduling plugins #  Trimaran is a collection of load-aware scheduler plugins described in Trimaran: Real Load Aware Scheduling.
Currently, the collection consists of the following plugins.
 TargetLoadPacking: Implements a packing policy up to a configured CPU utilization, then switches to a spreading policy among the hot nodes. (Supports CPU resource.) LoadVariationRiskBalancing: Equalizes the risk, defined as a combined measure of average utilization and variation in utilization, among nodes.</dcterms:abstract>
